==History==
2018
*The Magic Archer was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Magic Archer Draft Challenge]] which started on 16/2/2018. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], gameplay was similar to a regular Draft Challenge, except that one of the players was able to choose who would use the Magic Archer. If the player achieved 12 wins, they obtained the Magic Archer early.
*From 23/2/2018 through 26/2/2018, the [[Shop]] had a special offer where [[Arenas|Arena]] 11+ players could buy up to 9 special Fortune [[Chests]] for 1,000 [[Gems]] that had a 33% chance to contain a Magic Archer with the first and second Chest and guaranteed with the third. If a Magic Archer was obtained in the first or second Chest, then the third one would not guarantee it. The process was repeated with the next three trios of Chests.
*The Magic Archer [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 2/3/2018.
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], increased the Magic Archer's projectile speed to 1000 (from 800).
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], fixed a bug where the Magic Archer would extend his range and accidentally activate the [[King's Tower|King Tower]]. It also moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Magic Archer from Electro Valley to Hog Mountain.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5).
*On 5/11/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/11/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Magic Archer's first attack time interval to 0.9 seconds (from 0.4 seconds).
2019
*On 7/1/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Magic Archer's first attack time interval to 0.6 seconds (from 0.9 seconds).
*On 28/1/2019, the [[Version History#January%202019%20Update%20(28/1/2019)|January 2019 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Magic Archer from Hog Mountain to Spell Valley.
*On 15/4/2019, the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]], added two extra [[Star Points|Star Levels]].
*On 5/8/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/8/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Magic Archer's damage by 16%, increased his attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1 second), and decreased his first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.6 seconds).
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Magic Archer's card info screen.
2020 
*On 7/4/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Magic Archer's range to 6 tiles (from 7 tiles).
*On 5/5/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/5/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Magic Archer's range to 7 tiles (from 6 tiles), but also decreased his hitpoints by 10%.
2021 
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Magic Archer from Spell Valley to Rascal's Hideout.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2023
*On 6/2/2023, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/2/2023)|February 2023 Update]], changed the Magic Archer's card render.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 3/10/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/10/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Magic Archer's first attack time interval to 0.8 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
2024
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Magic Archer's first attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 0.8 seconds).
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Magic Archer's hitpoints by 0.2%.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Magic Archer's hitpoints by 0.18%, and his damage by 0.74%.
*On 1/12/2025, a Balance Update, increased the Magic Archer's damage by 8%.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Magic Archer's damage by 6%

