==Trivia==
*The word "''Archer''" comes from the Latin "''arcus"'', meaning bow. The practice of archery was first developed in Africa by the later Middle Stone Age (approx. 70,000 years ago). It is documented as part of warfare and hunting from the classical period until the late medieval period when it was made obsolete by the increased use of firearms. 
**The bow that Magic Archer uses in [[Basics of Battle|battle]] is a magical [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Recurve_bow recurve bow].
**In the Persian language setting of the game, the Magic Archer's name translates to "Magic Shooter".
**The Magic Archer is 1 of 10 [[cards]] associated with archery, with the others being [[Archers]], [[Arrows]], [[Tower Princess]], [[X-Bow]], [[Princess]], [[Super Magic Archer]], [[Super Archers]], [[Archer Queen]], and the [[Little Prince]].
*Among all troops with area damage, the Magic Archer is tied with Super Magic Archer and Super Archers for the smallest area damage radius of all troops, with a radius of 0.25 tiles.
*The Magic Archer is one of the first troop [[cards]] to receive a card render, alongside the Archers, [[Knight]], [[Goblins]], [[Bomber]], [[Skeletons]], [[Barbarians]], [[Bats]], [[Royal Recruits]], [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Rascals]], [[Musketeer]], [[Giant]], [[Valkyrie]], [[Wizard]], [[Flying Machine]], [[Hog Rider]], [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dart Goblin]], [[Zappies]], [[Elixir Golem]], [[Baby Dragon]], [[Skeleton Army]], [[Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], [[Prince]], [[Balloon]], [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Goblin Giant]], [[Hunter]], [[Electro Dragon]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Bowler]], [[Cannon Cart]], [[Mega Knight]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Miner]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Ice Wizard]], [[Bandit]], [[Lava Hound]], [[Night Witch]], and [[Fisherman]].
*The [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Super_Archer Super Archer] troop in Clash of Clans is likely inspired from the Magic Archer, with both being long range troops whose attacks pierce through enemy troops.
*Along with the [[Firecracker]], Rascals, Bandit, and the [[Boss Bandit]], the Magic Archer belongs to the Forest Gang.
*When deployed, the Magic Archer will say "''好的 (Hǎo de)''"'','' and when attacking, often says “''爆炸 (Bàozhà)''” which mean "''Ok''" and ''“Explode''“ in Chinese.
**The Magic Archer is 1 of 24 troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Mega Minion]], Wizard, Hog Rider, P.E.K.K.A., [[Dark Prince]], Bowler, Ram Rider, [[Electro Wizard]], Princess, Ice Wizard, [[Lumberjack]], [[Mother Witch]], Fisherman, [[Goblin Machine]], [[Super Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], Super Magic Archer, [[Golden Knight]], Boss Bandit, Archer Queen, Little Prince, and the [[Terry]].
*If the [[Boss Bandit]] is played when an allied Magic Archer is on the field, she says "''Cover me, sharp eyes!''".
*During the global release of Brawl Stars celebration, the Magic Archer was reskinned as [https://brawlstars.fandom.com/wiki/Bo Bo] in the [[Heist]] [[:Category:Modes|mode]].
*The Magic Archer is the subject of certain cosmetics in the game. More specifically:
**The Magic Archer is the subject of 3 [[Emotes]].
**The Magic Archer is the subject of a [[King's Tower|Tower Skin]].
*A [[Clone|cloned]] Magic Archer does not fall from the sky when deployed.
*On 27/3/2023, a [[Training Camp|Trainer]] was added to the game called Boss Cheddar, and used a Level 18 Magic Archer in their [[Battle Decks|deck]], despite the highest Level being Level 14 at the time. This Trainer was removed on 18/4/2023.
*The initial balance change for Magic Archer on the [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|5/3/2024 balance changes]] was a first attack time interval decrease to 0.6 seconds (from 0.8 seconds), but it was raised to 0.7 seconds [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-57-balance-wip last minute].
*The Magic Archer shares the same triangular logo on his belt as troops and defenses from Town Hall 15 (magic themed) in Clash of Clans, interestingly Magic Archer preceded the release of Town Hall 15 by 4 years.

